---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { nearby } from '../../data/nearby';
const title = '二寮觀日亭周邊景點｜草山月世界、左鎮化石園區與新化一日遊';
const description = '二寮日出後去哪裡？整理草山月世界、左鎮化石園區、岡林月世界生態學園、新化老街的特色、交通、地圖與半日一日路線。';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical="/nearby/" jsonLd={{ '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'CollectionPage', name:title, description, url:'https://erliaosunrise.com/nearby/' }}>
  <section class="bg-forest-950 pb-20 pt-32 text-white sm:pt-40"><div class="site-container"><nav class="text-sm text-white/60"><a href="/">首頁</a> / 周邊景點</nav><p class="eyebrow mt-8"><Icon name="route" size={16} /> 日出後的台南左鎮</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-serif text-[clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5rem)] font-bold leading-tight">二寮觀日亭周邊景點</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/70">看完日出，沿著白堊丘陵探索地質、化石、社區與歷史街區。每個景點都有自己的位置與順遊建議，不必來回切換搜尋。</p></div></section>
  <section class="bg-sand-50 py-16 sm:py-24"><div class="site-container"><h2 class="section-title">值得順遊的四個地方</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">{nearby.map((place) => <article class="paper-card overflow-hidden"><img src={`/images/nearby/${place.images[0]}`} alt={`${place.name}實景`} width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"/><div class="p-7"><p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest text-sun-600">{place.type}</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl font-bold">{place.name}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-forest-700">{place.summary}</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-forest-700">建議停留：{place.visit}</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="font-bold underline" href={`/nearby/${place.slug}/`}>閱讀完整遊覽指南</a><a class="font-bold underline" href={place.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google 地圖</a></div></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-24"><div class="site-container"><h2 class="section-title">半日與一日行程怎麼排？</h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="paper-card p-7"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold">半日｜日出與惡地景觀</h3><ol class="mt-5 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5 leading-7 text-forest-700"><li>日出前 60–90 分鐘抵達二寮。</li><li>日出後往<a href="/nearby/caoshan-moon-world/" class="underline">草山月世界</a>觀察侵蝕地形。</li><li>依體力安排早餐、補水與回程。</li></ol></article><article class="paper-card p-7"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold">一日｜自然地質與人文</h3><ol class="mt-5 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5 leading-7 text-forest-700"><li>二寮觀日亭與草山月世界。</li><li>確認開館後參觀<a href="/nearby/zuozhen-fossil-park/" class="underline">左鎮化石園區</a>。</li><li>回程至<a href="/nearby/xinhua-old-street/" class="underline">新化老街</a>散步與用餐。</li></ol></article></div><p class="mt-7 text-sm leading-7 text-forest-700">各景點開放、門票及道路管制可能變動。請核實官方公告；行程時間為編輯建議，非交通或營業時間保證。</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
